      (∀ j, ∀ y, ‖∑ m ∈ F j, D.c j G (D.blockOf I.1) (J j) m.1 * (D.Ms j G).wave m.1 y‖ ≤
        ∑ m ∈ F j, ‖D.c j G (D.blockOf I.1) (J j) m.1 *
