open Classical in
/-- Blueprint lines 2463-2480 for one core role `j` on an attempt leaf cell `I` (the per-role
content of `core_torus_form`): the selected wave sum of `F ⊆ E_h(a)` on the pre-cell is in torus
form on `I` with `γ = ω_a(x*)`, coefficients `α_m e(φ_m(x*))`, `ξ = θ/(Q₀ L_h)` and the explicit
